      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>",
