  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Height achieved in <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> collision is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math><br />Distance covered in first collision =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>,</p><p>Distance covered in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;collision =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi></math>, and so on.</p><p>Total distance covered by the ball before it comes to rest:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>from the sum of infinite geometric progression:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p>",
